  "description": "Neon Vibrant 90s Pop Culture Patterns is a beautifully crafted seamless pattern in neon tones, featuring a vibrant pop culture inspired design. This high-quality, seamless graphic is perfect for fabric printing, scrapbooking, digital paper crafts, wallpaper design, gift wrap, and other creative projects. Add a unique touch to your designs with this versatile and eye-catching pattern. \nWhat’s Included:\n• High-resolution JPG files\n• 12″ × 12″ (3600 × 3600 pixels)\n• 300 DPI for high-quality printing\n• Seamless repeating patterns\n• Ready for both print and digital use\nPerfect For:\n• Fabric & Textile Design\n• Sublimation Projects\n• Print-on-Demand Products\n• Scrapbooking & Card Making\n• Digital Planners & Journals\n• Wrapping Paper & Packaging\n• Stationery & Invitations\n• Home Décor & Wallpaper\n• Backgrounds for Websites & Social Media\n• DIY Crafts & Creative Projects\nThese seamless patterns are easy to use with most graphic design software and are ideal for creating beautiful, professional-quality products. Thank you for visiting my shop, and I hope this bundle inspires your next creative project!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Neon Vibrant 90s Pop Culture Patterns is a beautifully crafted seamless pattern in neon tones, featuring a vibrant pop culture inspired design. This high-quality, seamless graphic is perfect for fabric printing, scrapbooking, digital paper crafts, wallpaper design, gift wrap, and other creative projects. Add a unique touch to your designs with this versatile and eye-catching pattern. </p>\n<p>What’s Included:</p>\n<p>• High-resolution JPG files<br>\n• 12″ × 12″ (3600 × 3600 pixels)<br>\n• 300 DPI for high-quality printing<br>\n• Seamless repeating patterns<br>\n• Ready for both print and digital use</p>\n<p>Perfect For:</p>\n<p>• Fabric &amp; Textile Design<br>\n• Sublimation Projects<br>\n• Print-on-Demand Products<br>\n• Scrapbooking &amp; Card Making<br>\n• Digital Planners &amp; Journals<br>\n• Wrapping Paper &amp; Packaging<br>\n• Stationery &amp; Invitations<br>\n• Home Décor &amp; Wallpaper<br>\n• Backgrounds for Websites &amp; Social Media<br>\n• DIY Crafts &amp; Creative Projects</p>\n<p>These seamless patterns are easy to use with most graphic design software and are ideal for creating beautiful, professional-quality products. Thank you for visiting my shop, and I hope this bundle inspires your next creative project!</p>",
